DESCRIPTION:Inspired by and featuring song of Elvis Presley\, a guitar-playing young man rides into town and changes everything and everyone he meets with his hip-swiveling music. You’ll be tappin’ your feet to classics like Heartbreak Hotel\, Jailhouse Rock\, and Don’t Be Cruel. PG13 \nApproximate Run Time: 2 Hours\n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
