SUMMARY:Happy Together Tour at American Music Theatre
DESCRIPTION:2026 will mark the 17th year of the highly successful\, hit-filled summer package\, THE “HAPPY TOGETHER” TOUR. The touring sensation that has crisscrossed the nation delighting audiences for over a decade and a half returns this summer with a show full of chart-topping hits from the ‘60s and ‘70s – an undeniable 60+ BILLBOARD Top 40 smashes. The Tour is once again joined by THE ASSOCIATION\, THE TROGGS\, CHICAGO lead singer 1985-2016 JASON SCHEFF\, GARY PUCKETT\, THE FORTUNES\, RON DANTE from The Archies and The Turtles\, THE VOGUES and THE COWSILLS. \n(VIP1) HAPPY TOGETHER:  $191 \nIncludes: \n\nOne Premium Reserved In Rows 2-5\nOne\, VIP Only\, Tour Poster Autographed By Graphic Artist / Designer*\nLimited Availability\n\n*Poster shipped directly to purchasers after the show has concluded *tour poster is limited\, numbered & signed by the graphic artist that designed the poster** **poster autographed by graphic artist\, NOT band members performing at the show.  \n(VIP2) HAPPY TOGETHER: $180 \nIncludes: \n\nOne Premium Reserved In Rows 5-15\nOne\, VIP Only\, Tour Poster Autographed By Graphic Artist / Designer*\nLimited Availability\n\n  \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
